674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L6OT72TsPlYQ7kNvwFJDtZ9&_nc_oc=AdqRLE7jrZmrpG0vd4n5YpHF1tAssB6VIcB_3EdH9k7SKk4IKgJUv4s9hTH3Z97EpfA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1reQoThKDB7flwwBg-yn4oFJKFc-g6G7P9xe7GzdjdzQ&oe=69F75C59"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_qoxj9jkvZUQ7kNvwF_d9Nt&_nc_oc=AdpMWkocUwpWROKAi5riBRV4vzJ0GLRgKzeRZRV1i-xYhInoa9EeMyxzWnNa5R5HL7M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1-ez_KfVgEmWsBFucAJaVcWK6KfagNRWjWnA2izgs97g&oe=69F76516"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZAM7PvqZh_MQ7kNvwEZBnNy&_nc_oc=AdpDIGiSxDJAjG2Xwlx6mut5SL6lFYd_NCYS9hEETUdsKTU6nxoyZEWWm7NIVLUPnr8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3G_5gh771G4j6YbeLcKpwGZ2BlTwFuNrCGJ3MHb2XJdw&oe=69F76131"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip